---
// This is the Astro component file for the Core Services section.
// It uses Tailwind CSS for styling.
---

<style>
  /*
      Custom styles to handle the hover effects on the animated-card.
      The hover effects on the icon-container have been removed.
    */
  .animated-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 12px;
    transition:
      transform 0.3s ease-in-out,
      box-shadow 0.3s ease-in-out;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .animated-card:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    transform: translateY(-5px); /* Adds a slight lift effect on hover */
  }

  /* The icon-container styles are now for positioning only, no hover transforms */
  .icon-container {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: flex-start;
  }
</style>

<section
  id="CoreServices"
  class="min-h-[100vh] flex items-top py-10 bg-gradient-to-b from-white via-white to-[#e6f4d6] overflow-x-hidden pt-20 pb-10 sm:py-20 font-[poppins,sans-serif]"
>
  <div class="container mx-auto px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-5xl">
        Our Services
      </h2>
      <div class="w-24 h-1 mx-auto mt-4 bg-yellow-500 rounded"></div>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto text-lg text-gray-600">
        We specialize in delivering comprehensive project management services
        across diverse industry sectors, bringing domain expertise and proven
        methodologies to every project.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div
      class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 justify-center mb-8"
    >
      <div
        class="animated-card bg-white rounded-xl shadow-2xl border border-gray-200 p-6"
      >
        <div class="icon-container mb-4">
          <img src="/Agri.svg" alt="Agri Icon" class="w-16 h-16" />
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 pb-4 text-left">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Agri & Food Processing</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
            Defense manufacturing facilities, aerospace infrastructure, testing
            laboratories, and security installations.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="mt-auto pt-4 border-t border-gray-200 flex justify-between items-center text-sm text-gray-700 font-semibold"
        >
          <div>
            <p class="text-base text-green-800 font-bold">12+ Projects</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-green-800">Completed</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-base text-green-800 font-bold">₹1200+ Crores</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-text-green-800">Project Value</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="animated-card bg-white rounded-xl shadow-2xl border border-gray-200 p-6"
      >
        <div class="icon-container mb-4">
          <img src="/Aerospaces.svg" alt="Agri Icon" class="w-16 h-16" />
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 pb-4 text-left">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Aerospace & Defence</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
            Defense manufacturing facilities, aerospace infrastructure, testing
            laboratories, and security installations.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="mt-auto pt-4 border-t border-gray-200 flex justify-between items-center text-sm text-gray-700 font-semibold"
        >
          <div>
            <p class="text-base text-green-800 font-bold">12+ Projects</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-green-800">Completed</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-base text-green-800 font-bold">₹1200+ Crores</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-text-green-800">Project Value</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="animated-card bg-white rounded-xl shadow-2xl border border-gray-200 p-6"
      >
        <div class="icon-container mb-4">
          <img
            src="/Electronics.svg"
            alt="Agri Icon"
            class="w-16 h-16"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 pb-4 text-left">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Electronics & IT</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
            IT parks, electronics manufacturing units, data centers, and
            technology infrastructure projects.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="mt-auto pt-4 border-t border-gray-200 flex justify-between items-center text-sm text-gray-700 font-semibold"
        >
          <div>
            <p class="text-base text-green-800 font-bold">38+ Projects</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-green-800">Completed</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-base text-green-800 font-bold">₹950+ Crores</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-green-800">Project Value</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="w-full lg:w-2/3 mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 justify-center mb-6"
    >
      <div
        class="animated-card bg-white rounded-xl shadow-2xl border border-gray-200 p-6"
      >
        <div class="icon-container mb-4">
          <img src="/Textile.svg" alt="Agri Icon" class="w-16 h-16" />
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 pb-4 text-left">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Textile</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
            Textile manufacturing units, garment factories, dyeing facilities,
